tyle=\"font-size:11px;color:#767469;margin-top:6px\">획 데이터: Make Me a Hanzi (Arphic Public License)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;border-top:3px solid #A8792B;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin:26px 0;background:#F5F3EE\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:17px;color:#0D1725;margin-bottom:4px\">오늘의 한 문장</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:14px\">오늘 배운 글자가 진짜 기사 제목에 이렇게 나왔습니다</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.6;color:#0D1725;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;word-break:keep-all;margin-bottom:8px\">武夷山<span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">现</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">在</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">能</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">看</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">见</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">雪</span>山<span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">吗</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:6px\">Wǔyí Shān xiànzài néng kànjiàn xuěshān ma</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">우이산에서 지금 설산을 볼 수 있습니까?</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px;padding:10px 14px;background:#fff;border-left:3px solid #A8792B;font-size:15px;color:#24272E;line-height:1.7;word-break:keep-all\">오늘 배운 雪가 山과 붙어 &#x27;눈 덮인 산&#x27;이라는 낱말이 됐고, 문장 끝의 吗가 이것을 질문으로 만들었습니다.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">雪山</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">xuěshān</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">설산, 눈 덮인 산</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">现在</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">xiànzài</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">지금, 현재</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">能</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">néng</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">~할 수 있다</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">看见</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">kànjiàn</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">보이다, 보다</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">吗</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">ma</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">문장 끝에 붙어 질문을 만드는 말</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:8px 0\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:4px\">이 문장 듣기</div>\n<p><audio controls preload=\"none\" src=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/day43-news.mp3\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:420px\"><a href=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/day43-news.mp3\">소리 내려받기</a></audio></div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#767469\">출처 <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE5VR3NFNDRIb1M3SXZrSlMtMV9GZElXMWVjbDJfdFExaV9hNWcwNUswRXNvUkJMNW55eDhLRXJiUGh6U20yM3ZHaVNYaHVUY1ZZakJSa3hlRTFxR3BhMGlJ?oc=5\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#767469\">新浪网</a> · 기사 제목 한 줄만 인용했습니다</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:2px solid #A8792B;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin:26px 0;background:#FDF6E7\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:17px;color:#0D1725;margin-bottom:10px\">오늘 배운 것</div>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:15px\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">今天天气怎么样</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">jīntiān tiānqì zěnmeyàng</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">오늘 날씨 어때요?</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">冷</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">lěng</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">춥다, 차다</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">晴天</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">qíngtiān</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">맑은 날, 갠 날씨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">下雪</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">xià xuě</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">눈이 오다</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">风</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">fēng</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">바람</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-top:1px solid #E5E1D8;margin:30px 0 0;padding:16px 0 0\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:4px\">지난 수업</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://daytip.kr/?p=2525\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#8C6423;text-decoration:underline;word-break:keep-all\">← 会·能·可以 차이와 부정형 정리 (중국어 42일차)</a></p>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-top:8px\">하루 한 편씩 쌓는 중입니다. 오늘이 43일차입니다. <a href=\"https://daytip.kr/chinese-course/\" style=\"color:#8C6423\">전체 목차 →</a></div>\n</div>\n",
